    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "[SAM]:  Alright. Real talk. You've built this thing up from \"invents pizza\" to running most of my window. There's one test left.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-e0a9bcf5-aa9e-443d-a879-725e04f602e9",
        "typing": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": false
      },
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: You hear that? ...That's a school bus. Two of them. It's 3pm on the hottest day of the year.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-0c3cc5e2-306f-4680-a231-81a4c98f04fd",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: I'm going full scoop mode. The window is YOURS — well, your agent's. Everything you taught it is about to get tested at once.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-5ea2ca70-9731-48d5-8da0-199f0863e0d3",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: Every rule you wrote, every tool it has. Don't call me unless it's real.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-8823d531-5f2b-49fe-b76e-6f7a4c0a5204",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "[SAM]: Good luck.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "undefined-7b46e7f5-ca1e-4332-a4c3-fba6bd9b9c34",
        "typing": true,
